aat 🙏\nAgar aap ghar par Ghatasthapana setup kar rahe ho, ye real-life inspired puja setup idea aapko perfect guidance dega.\n\nIs image me aapko milega ek authentic Indian home temple setup — brass kalash with coconut \u0026 mango leaves, ghee diyas, marigold flowers, rudraksha mala, aur soft sunlight ke saath ek pure devotional vibe ✨\n\n💛 Aaj ka rang: Yellow (Peela)\n🪔 Bhog: Desi Ghee\n🕉️ Mantra: Om Devi Shailaputryai Namah\n\nYe setup beginners ke liye bhi perfect hai — simple, traditional aur spiritually powerful.\n\n\n#Navratri2026 #MaaShailputri #Ghatasthapana #NavratriPuja #IndianFestival #PujaSetup #HomeTemple #SpiritualIndia #NavratriDecor #HinduFestival","is_downstream_promotion":false,"created_at":"Thu, 19 Mar 2026 05:10:04 +0000","is_eligible_for_pdp":false,"recommendation_reason":{"reason":"RECGPT_CG_USER_TO_PINS"},"title":"Navratri Day 1 Puja Setup at Home 🙏 Maa Shailputri Ghatasthapana Ideas","is_premiere":false,"access":[],"digital_media_source_type":11,"images":{"170x":{"width":236,"height":354,"url":"https://i.pinimg.com/236x/a2/dd/fe/a2ddfe30807a320b83fef789e7e57b55.jpg"},"236x":{"width":236,"height":354,"url":"https://i.pinimg.com/236x/a2/dd/fe/a2ddfe30807a320b83fef789e7e57b55.jpg"},"474x":{"width":474,"height":711,"url":"https://i.pinimg.com/474x/a2/dd/fe/a2ddfe30807a320b83fef789e7e57b55.jpg"},"564x":{"width":564,"height":846,"url":"https://i.pinimg.com/564x/a2/dd/fe/a2ddfe30807a320b83fef789e7e57b55.jpg"},"736x":{"width":736,"height":1104,"url":"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/a2/dd/fe/a2ddfe30807a320b83fef789e7e57b55.jpg"},"orig":{"width":1024,"height":1536,"url":"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/a2/dd/fe/a2ddfe30807a320b83fef789e7e57b55.png"}},"link_utm_applicable_and_replaced":0,"closeup_unified_attribution":{"node_id":"VXNlcjo5NDc4NjcxOTAyMzE4NTY3OTA=","image_small_url":"https://i.pinimg.com/30x30_RS/f9/de/e3/f9dee3b915b06cc34305d148f6af9af4.jpg","full_name":"Divine Sutra","explicitly_followed_by_me":false,"username":"mydivinesutra","is_primary_web